$ CONM2 10. with c.g. offset (-3, 0, -2) and inertias 1, 1, 1 in basic. The rotation block of the mass at grid 1 has
$ the term m*dx*dz with the sign of the parallel-axis rule; with the wrong sign the mass matrix is indefinite.
$ Grid 1 carries the CONM2 and is held by six CELAS2 springs (k = 1000, 2000, ... 6000 in its CD components 1-6) to
$ grid 2, which is fixed. Expected eigenvalues of K phi = lambda M phi, from the exact rigid-mass matrix at grid 1:
$   3.130576E+01, 3.314892E+01, 1.322273E+02, 4.584938E+03, 3.158191E+04, 3.623647E+04
SOL 103
CEND
TITLE = CONM2_OFFSET_EIGEN
METHOD = 1
BEGIN BULK
EIGR,1,GIV,,,,6
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.
GRID,2,,0.,0.,0.,,123456
CONM2,4501,1,,10.,-3.,0.,-2.,,+M1
+M1,1.,,1.,,,1.
CELAS2,101,1000.0,1,1,2,1
CELAS2,102,2000.0,1,2,2,2
CELAS2,103,3000.0,1,3,2,3
CELAS2,104,4000.0,1,4,2,4
CELAS2,105,5000.0,1,5,2,5
CELAS2,106,6000.0,1,6,2,6
ENDDATA
